Vendored XZ decoder (decode path used by LinuxModule for the Debian rootfs).

Source: https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz-java (XZ for Java)
License: public domain (see COPYING in the upstream repo: "Permission to use,
copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any purpose with or without
fee is hereby granted.").

Vendored instead of depending on org.tukaani:xz from Maven so the app builds
fully offline: the only consumer is LinuxModule's .tar.xz extraction.
